  questTitle: Issue the Order Books
  questDescription: The Student Director received the proposal and certainly thought that they were not the normal currency notes. He suspected that there were other usages of the notes,therefore he is giving out an order that if anyone receives these kind of notes again in future, they must be brought back and reported to him. Retrieve the Order Books from the Financial Group to the Security Guard at the main entrance, and then deliver the Order Books to the Technical Teacher and Physics Teacher.
